     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "eviews_text = \"\"\"\n",
    "' A small model in EViews format\n",
    "log(c) = 0.5*log(yd) + 0.4*log(c(-1)) + 0.1\n",
    "@identity yd = y - t\n",
    "@identity y = c + i + g\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "Meviews = Makemodel(eviews_text, type_input='eviews')\n",
    "Meviews.show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "834bf941",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Adjusting a preset\n",
    "\n",
    "A preset only fills in what is not given, so any of the four arguments can be overridden while the\n",
    "rest of the preset is kept. The translation functions take options of their own, which\n",
    "`functools.partial` binds:\n",
    "\n",
    "* `gekko_to_modelflow(stmt, code_map=...)` -- a dict from code to tags, or a function of the code;\n",
    "  codes missing from a dict get the default translation;\n",
    "* `eviews_to_modelflow(stmt, behavioral_opts=...)` -- the tags for the behavioural equations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "0dee29b9",
   "metadata": {},
